OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft says email queues
OL,4,A'approaching normal levels' after
OL,5,Aglobal outage hits Outlook and Teams
OL,6,Ausers
OL,7,
OL,8,FNHS England says the outage is
OL,9,F"inevitably" disrupting staff but
OL,10,Fappointments can continue; schools have
OL,11,Fbeen asking parents to get in touch via
OL,12,Fphone; US federal government and court
OL,13,Fsystems are also reporting issues
OL,15,FSouth African winemaker Peter Pentz
OL,16,Ftells us communication with exporters
OL,17,Fhas been brought "to a standstill".
OL,18,FMeanwhile, a group in London say they
OL,19,Fleft the office because if emails
OL,20,Fweren't working "it was time to go to
OL,21,Fthe pub"
